<newsitem itemid="759866" id="root" date="1997-07-28" xml:lang="en">
<title>CHINA: Chun Tai announces first final results.</title>
<headline>Chun Tai announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	24.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     3.15</p>
<p>    Net			 62.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		  525.75</p>
<p>    Company name	    Chun Tai Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     Sept 10-16</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	Oct 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Consumer electronics products manufacturer Chun Tai was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on February 3.</p>
<p>Exceptional items for the year arise from HK$9.64 million interest income earned from subscription monies received from the new issue and HK$6.5 million compensation interest on early redemption of a convertible note.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
